From: Song Qing <songqing.sq@alibaba-inc.com>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add native component build and runtime interfaces

Backport the reviewed implementation from build-infra PR #67, source
1341eaf4a7759ef0121ae7c17edcd0000d063038, onto the existing published
17a1e555291c64be1a6ff008f33352bffc4f8e5c archive. FRR and libteam need
native compiler/runtime interfaces, Bookworm tools and matching OCI TARs.
Keep one shared Bookworm tool set with separate Perl and instrumentation
subsets and retain the source's native, ABI and packaging regressions.

The original version/visibility patches are applied first and unchanged;
this backport keeps the published module version and archive identity.

Co-authored-by: Guohan Lu <securely1g@gmail.com>

